  "If blue is true, the {0} in {1} is placed, and {2} loses its {3}.": "Si el azul es verdadero, se coloca el {0} de {1} y {2} pierde su {3}.",
  "If gold is true, the {0} in {1} is placed, and {2} loses its {3}. {4} would then be empty, so gold is false.": "Si el dorado es verdadero, se coloca el {0} de {1} y {2} pierde su {3}. Entonces {4} quedaría vacía, así que el dorado es falso.",
